ass=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"70.6\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,89.5 14.2,91.6 19.3,89.5 24.5,84.9 29.6,82.7 34.7,74.4 39.8,79.0 44.9,77.5 50.0,78.5 55.1,81.1 60.3,79.0 65.4,80.7 70.5,83.7 75.6,74.6 80.7,78.5 85.8,75.7 91.0,72.4 96.1,60.1 101.2,67.4 106.3,58.0 111.4,59.3 116.5,52.1 121.6,43.7 126.8,33.1 131.9,28.7 137.0,12.8 142.1,25.5 147.2,39.5 152.3,40.0 157.4,53.2 162.6,44.4 167.7,42.7 172.8,49.4 177.9,49.8 183.0,53.4 188.1,59.0 193.2,58.5 198.4,62.9 203.5,66.6 208.6,66.4 213.7,74.5 218.8,77.7 223.9,74.8 229.0,70.6 234.2,70.2 239.3,56.4 244.4,61.5 249.5,70.4 254.6,58.1 259.7,51.1 264.9,51.5 270.0,52.0 275.1,51.5 280.2,50.6 285.3,49.7 290.4,53.6 295.5,60.0 300.7,58.8 305.8,57.6 310.9,54.7 316.0,52.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 193.2 70.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 249.5 82.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"52.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"53.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c6